<p> Muriate of Potash   686 (ULD)  8,805    Hun Jian	   1/11</p>
<p> Urea		  1,188 (ULD)  9,196    Sai Kung	   1/11</p>
<p> Bentonite	   1,295 (ULD)    680    Asha Global	5/11</p>
<p> Granite		 690 (LDD)  1,595    Madras Express   5/11</p>
<p>Iron Ore</p>
<p>  Concentrate     39,000 (LDD) 21,000    Iran Madani	7/11</p>
<p> LPG		   5,000 (ULD)    ---    Vashishi	   6/10</p>
